# Release the extension > Preparing
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/release-the-extension.md#L48
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

whole::a Take a version through the release ::e
prep::a Prepare the version ::e --::P--> whole

pin::a Pin the toolchain ref ::e
  --> bump::a Bump the version ::e
  --> write::a Write the changelog entry ::e
pin, bump, write --::P--> prep

dev::a Release maintainer --> pin, bump, write
ref::a .github/ipm-tools.ref --> pin
manifest::a package.json --> bump
log::a CHANGELOG.md --> write

dev --> Maintainer ::c
ref --> pinned ref ::c
manifest --> Markdown page ::c
log --> changelog ::c
